  "_about": "Sport, generated by design/gen_hud.py: a shift bar and its scale across the top (scale and colour zones follow the Redline setting), oil and coolant (readout slots) under it on the left, the gear big in the middle, a boost arc on the right. Fitted (Nov 9 2026) to the HUD as BMW's own height-adjust frame shows it, x 120..680, y 100..380, and kept clear of the bottom-left x 120..350, y 235..380, where BMW draws its speed and speed-limit sign (and in Sport its rev band) over ours. To change it, copy this file into the app data folder layouts/ (scripts/deploy.sh); the app reloads it by itself. Widget types and tokens: see the header of hud.js.",
